# Send only runtime source, dependency locks and container tooling to the builder.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!backend/
!backend/**
!ml/
!ml/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!docker/
!docker/**
!data/processed/
!data/processed/**
!data/docs/
!data/docs/**

# The small tracked runtime inputs (data/processed, data/docs, ml/artifacts) ARE copied into the
# backend image so a hosted container (e.g. Render) can run real mode without bind mounts.
# Never bake local environments, caches, private plans or raw downloaded data in.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
backend/tests
ml/tests
